        "body": "Addressed all three points:\n\n1. **`FcmPayload.apns` footgun** — Added `debug_assert!(payload.apns.is_none())` with a comment that APNS config is transport-owned in `fcm_sender.rs`. This makes the contract explicit without runtime cost in release builds.\n\n2. **Title/body duplication in APNS custom data** — Filtering `title` and `body` keys from the data `HashMap` before passing to `ApnsConfig::new()` in the alert path. The alert payload no longer duplicates these values.\n\n3. **Dead comment cleanup** — Removed the `// Removed unused imports` comment.\n\nSee commit f703b59.",
